      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive Extended 3-Bedroom Home with Excellent B3 Energy Rating.\n\nGary Wildman of Casey Kennedy Estate Agents (CKP) are delighted to present 50B Barry Park to the Finglas West property market.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition throughout, this beautifully extended three-bedroom, one-bathroom family home offers stylish, light-filled modern living. This superb family homes comes with an outstanding B3 BER rating making it eligible for attractive Green Mortgage rates. Having been carefully updated and thoughtfully extended, the property provides comfortable, turnkey accommodation ideal for first-time buyers, growing families, or investors looking for a prime property in a well-established Dublin location.\n\nKey Features Property Type:\n\nExtended 3-Bedroom Terraced House\n\nEnergy Rating: Impressive B3 BER Rating \n\nCondition: Presented in excellent condition throughout no works required \n\nLiving Space: Cleverly extended ground-floor layout creating bright, spacious living areas.\n\nAccommodation Breakdown \n\nEntrance Hall: Bright and welcoming entrance hallway leading to main living areas. \n\nLiving Area: Generous, comfortable living room featuring high-quality finishes and an abundance of natural light.\n\nKitchen / Dining / Extended Living Space: \n\nThe centerpiece of the home. Features a modern, fully fitted kitchen with ample storage. The rear extension opens up the floor plan to create a vibrant dining/family room space with garden access.\n\nBedrooms: Three well-proportioned, bright bedrooms upstairs, tastefully finished with modern flooring and decor.\n\nBathroom: Stylishly appointed family bathroom featuring contemporary sanitary ware, tiled finish, and clean modern fittings.\n\nExterior: Low-maintenance private garden to the rear, perfect for outdoor dining, with convenient off-street parking to the front.\n\nLocation & Amenities 50B Barry Park is situated in a highly convenient and established area of Finglas West. The property benefits from immediate access to a range of local amenities: \n\nTransport: Excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre, including regular Dublin Bus routes. Immediate proximity to the M50 and N2 motorways, providing easy access to Dublin Airport and the national road network.\n\nAmenities: Nearby Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, Finglas Village and clear proximity to local parks, sports facilities,primary/secondary schools.\n\nInstitutions: Within easy reach of DCU, Dublin Airport and major local employment hubs.\n\nViewing Details: Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, layout and thermal efficiency of this exceptional property. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact gary@ckp.ie https://youtube.com/shorts/HHLPAcbKjO8"
      },
